>> title: Miso Ginger Dressing
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: miso, ginger, sesame, salad, no-cook
>> counters: Ramen Shop, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: ginger dressing, miso dressing, house ginger dressing
>> servings: 8
>> time: 10 min

>> step: whisk smooth
Whisk @white miso{2%Tbs}(35 g) with @rice vinegar{3%Tbs}(45 mL) and @soy sauce{1%Tbs} until no lumps remain.

>> step: whisk in
Whisk @ginger{1%Tbs}(grated), @garlic{1%clove}(grated), and @honey{2%tsp} into @&(~1)miso{}.

>> step: stream in, whisk to emulsify
Stream @neutral oil{1/3%cup}(80 mL) and @toasted sesame oil{2%tsp} into @&(~1)base{} in a thin thread.

>> step: thin to pouring consistency
Thin @&(~1)dressing{} with @water{1%Tbs} until it pours off a spoon.
